    "body": "# Fleet Transfer\n\n`fleet.transfer` is the official file-system adapter for Fleet's direct-only\nfile transfer path. Fleet core authenticates the account and endpoints, signs a\nshort-lived WebRTC ticket, and requires explicit approval on both devices. The\nplugin then reads or writes one regular file through a bounded streaming ABI.\n\nFile bytes use a dedicated reliable WebRTC DataChannel. The Worker and Durable\nObject carry only authentication, signaling, status, and short-lived tickets.\nIf a direct connection cannot be established, the transfer fails instead of\nfalling back to WebSocket, Worker, R2, TURN, or another relay.\n\nVersion 0.1.0 supports one file, SHA-256 integrity, verified resume checkpoints,\nsafe cancellation, and no-clobber publication. Directories, symbolic links,\nspecial files, overwrite, and cross-account transfer are deliberately excluded."
